WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.400
I founded Elias Net because I believe technology's true value is not in replacing people,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:12.500
but in helping us see more clearly, respond more quickly,
and safely reach places we could not reach before.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.300
From enterprise systems to medical support and rescue operations,

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:24.900
our AI helps people understand information, prepare decisions,
and carry out authorized tasks.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:31.700
But purpose, boundaries and final decisions
will always remain in human hands.

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:36.400
What we are building is not only more intelligent technology,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.150
but a future people can trust and move toward together.
